## Keyword Search Function

```python
def keyword_search(query, documents):
    results = []

    for doc in documents:
        score = len(
            set(query.lower().split())
            &
            set(doc.lower().split())
        )

        results.append((score, doc))

    results.sort(reverse=True)

    return results[:5]
```

