## Conclusion

This project demonstrated how semantic search can retrieve information based on meaning rather than exact keyword matches. By combining OpenAI Embeddings with FAISS, we built a scalable retrieval system capable of understanding user intent and providing more relevant search results than traditional keyword-based approaches. FAISS enables efficient nearest-neighbor search over embedding vectors, making it suitable for large-scale semantic retrieval systems.
